<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Banerj sale may take place in Feb.</title>
<headline>Brazil Banerj sale may take place in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of Rio de Janeiro state bank Banerj may be held in February, said Rio de Janeiro state Planning Secretary Marco Aurelio Alencar.</p>
<p>&quot;We will publish a new tender document for Banerj's sell-off in January and the auction may take place in February,&quot; Alencar told a press conference.</p>
<p>Banerj's sell-off has been postponed twice already due to a court ruling.</p>
<p>The tender document will be published as soon as the state government creates guarantees of around two billion reais to cover debts including those owed to pension funds and to individual employees, Alencar said.</p>
<p>((-Fatima Cristina, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
